@lang en
IMPORT `lpa-termination`

-- Liberty personal accident rules, UW-PAG-W-001-10-V: how much is payable.
-- PHẠM VI BẢO HIỂM (benefits A to D and the geographical scope, src 307-527), HẠN MỨC CHUNG
-- (the limit per conveyance, src 533-542) and HẠN MỨC BẢO HIỂM ĐỐI VỚI MỖI NGƯỜI ĐƯỢC BẢO HIỂM
-- (the limitations for each insured, src 544-578).
--
-- These rules compute what a benefit would pay on facts the cover decision (lpa-claim.l4) has
-- already found covered. A benefit the schedule does not include (NOTHING) pays nothing: the
-- wording makes each benefit the policyholder's choice (src 311-314).

§ `I. Benefits`

-- The chapeau: on the choice of the policyholder or the insured, the contract covers death /
-- permanent injury, temporary injury / hospital allowance, and medical expenses.
-- src:309 | I. Quyền lợi bảo hiểm
