-- 3: the permanent injury benefit is paid once the total is agreed, or, at the insured's
-- request, in instalments at least 30 days apart (no advance), beginning 30 days after the
-- Company receives notice of the Injury. Fork F18: "sau 30 ngày kể từ" is the day 30 days
-- after, and "từ 30 ngày trở lên" means a gap of 30 days or more.
