-- src:571 | kể từ khi Công ty nhận được thông báo về Thương tật.
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the days between instalments of benefit A.2` MEANS 30

GIVEN `the day the Company received notice of the injury` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`limitation 3: the first day an instalment may be paid, notice received on` `the day the Company received notice of the injury` MEANS
    `the day the Company received notice of the injury` PLUS `the days between instalments of benefit A.2`

GIVEN `the day of the last instalment` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`limitation 3: the first day the next instalment may be paid, the last paid on` `the day of the last instalment` MEANS
    `the day of the last instalment` PLUS `the days between instalments of benefit A.2`

